    "name": "credential-public-v1",
    "note": "One configuration measures every population, so config_hash is equal across them and only the evidence differs. The linux-x64 file is canonical (the CI platform). A darwin-arm64 run differs in its two executable pins, so in config_hash and semantic digest, and is never compared with a linux run.",
